WEBVTT

00:02:56.506 --> 00:03:01.212
452 cities, 22 regions,
549 universities around the world

00:03:01.236 --> 00:03:03.411
have joined the Race to Zero,

00:03:03.435 --> 00:03:06.133
and many more are preparing to do so.

00:03:06.157 --> 00:03:08.292
But we need to go further.

00:03:08.618 --> 00:03:13.306
Between now and the UN Climate Conference,
COP26, in November 2021,

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.648
we want to accelerate the pace
across the global economy.

00:03:18.184 --> 00:03:19.865
We're at a turning point.

00:03:19.889 --> 00:03:21.756
We don't have time to waste.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:23.836
And you can help

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.911
by making sure that the company
or community where you work

00:03:26.935 --> 00:03:28.885
joins the race today.